@startuml
title Data-Flow Design of Nihongo AI Study

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

actor Learner

rectangle "Next.js UI" as UI
rectangle "Next.js API Routes" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
rectangle "Recommendation Engine" as REC
rectangle "RAG Retriever" as RAG
cloud "OpenRouter /\nOpenAI-compatible API" as AI

Learner --> UI : Learner actions
UI --> API : API requests

API --> DB : Store / load\nprofile, progress,\nquiz, activity logs
DB --> REC : Profile, placement,\nprogress, quiz attempts,\nactivity logs
REC --> API : Ranked learning actions
API --> UI : Learning path\nand recommendations

UI --> API : Chat message
API --> RAG : Retrieve sources
RAG --> DB : Query knowledge chunks
DB --> RAG : Relevant chunks
RAG --> API : Grounding context
API --> AI : Prompt with context
AI --> API : Generated answer
API --> DB : Store chat log
API --> UI : Answer with sources

@enduml
